{
  "about": "Each row and each tool names the editions it is in (editions: magnusim, cad), and each Magnusim CAD row the CAD app's control a person uses for it (cad_control: where it is reached, and its selector; D rows are the Assistant dock's own controls); tool_editions names every host and core page tool, with the values it keeps in Magnusim CAD (cad_values: assistant-routes.ts CAD_EDITION_TOOLS). Every Tier 0 and Tier 1 row of the core parity audit, and the Tier 2 rows the host tools cover, with the Assistant's way to do it (core host tools spec 1.5). A row has tool paths (tool, where: its enum values or its properties, routes: HOST_ROUTES ids the tool's code calls, or page: a core page tool), a deferral (named in the release notes' Not yet list), person_only (never a tool) or not_owed (route only, no UI). scripts/__tests__/assistant-parity.test.mjs holds it to the code.",
